    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/a439e0c7b7015072311af4a7e2e51c66.avif?t=1735632935\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in a quiet and picturesque courtyard, where beautiful women in swimsuits relax, connecting with their inner world and nature. They capture occasional flashes of inspiration from their minds, which become points for you to collect. You don\u2019t need to do anything\u2014just follow their pace, relax together, and experience healing for your soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress Up Your Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of swimsuits, hairstyles, and accessories that can be exchanged for points. You can dress her in the outfits you find most beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/e6b5f7433dc2ba8b77799097f507254a.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/247eccfa4542820ed4e04aca57769d51.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/1c726430551b8105af004e65963a117d.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/f86d308618a3b3e5e625f7643c169af6.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate Your Courtyard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides hundreds of decorative items for the courtyard, which can be exchanged for points. Gradually make your courtyard more beautiful and vibrant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/facfcfb95bb4b8e78a313e005b6c430c.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/73d6d5c0b60c66e16c05c329f89caf2e.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple and Relaxing Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idle game, so players do not need to perform additional actions most of the time. When the women meditate, they generate many useful ideas, which are automatically collected to earn points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/092d33613f825c102c2441383814d82d.avif?t=1735632935\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/a439e0c7b7015072311af4a7e2e51c66.avif?t=1735632935\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in a quiet and picturesque courtyard, where beautiful women in swimsuits relax, connecting with their inner world and nature. They capture occasional flashes of inspiration from their minds, which become points for you to collect. You don\u2019t need to do anything\u2014just follow their pace, relax together, and experience healing for your soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress Up Your Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of swimsuits, hairstyles, and accessories that can be exchanged for points. You can dress her in the outfits you find most beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/e6b5f7433dc2ba8b77799097f507254a.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/247eccfa4542820ed4e04aca57769d51.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/1c726430551b8105af004e65963a117d.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/f86d308618a3b3e5e625f7643c169af6.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate Your Courtyard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides hundreds of decorative items for the courtyard, which can be exchanged for points. Gradually make your courtyard more beautiful and vibrant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/facfcfb95bb4b8e78a313e005b6c430c.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/73d6d5c0b60c66e16c05c329f89caf2e.avif?t=1735632935\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple and Relaxing Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idle game, so players do not need to perform additional actions most of the time. When the women meditate, they generate many useful ideas, which are automatically collected to earn points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409390/extras/092d33613f825c102c2441383814d82d.avif?t=1735632935\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
